<title>USA: Sonat Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Sonat Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.78		    $0.53</p>
<p> Net		 66,846		   45,569</p>
<p> Revs		1,122,289		734,406</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  86,229		   86,128</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company's operating income was $106.9 million versus $83.2 million for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Analyst consensus for the earings per share for the quarter was $0.74, according to First Call.</p>
</text>
